odot/pulls/123231","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123231","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123231.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123231.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nThe operation `~3` was operating on a signed 32-bit integer, but it should be a `uint64_t`.\r\n\r\nThis is code that I put there - my bad for being sloppy with integer types in the past.\r\n\r\nThis PR fixes a sanitizer error reported by CI:\r\n\r\n> modules/gltf/gltf_document.cpp:6811:58: runtime error: implicit conversion from type 'int' of value -4 (32-bit, signed) to type 'unsigned long' changed the value to 18446744073709551612 (64-bit, unsigned)\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nI used AI by copy-pasting Godot sanitizer errors to it and telling it to fix them. Then, I am investigating each manually, and submitting PRs when I am confident of the fix. This one is quite trivial.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123231/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123231/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}